{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（18日）上午11時16分，馬鞍山西沙路私人屋苑「銀湖‧天峰」的保安員報案，指一名青年由低層單位墮下。人員到場經檢驗，證實該名19歲男子當場身亡。</p><figure><img alt=\"「銀湖‧天峰」一名19歲青年墮樓身亡，毋須送院。（朱子熙攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260818/1166364158133014528621908.jpeg/Mu0DYbhD43unYCw4QyWib1vqhMSYI-mjn1hLibpYS4k\"/><figcaption>「銀湖‧天峰」一名19歲青年墮樓身亡，毋須送院。（朱子熙攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"「銀湖‧天峰」一名19歲青年墮樓身亡。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260818/1166364155293339648720534.jpeg/BSW4O3Muy_D3H5DVH2AFvwPqpS1PlPx8eDFt8F0xbfA\"/><figcaption>「銀湖‧天峰」一名19歲青年墮樓身亡。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"「銀湖‧天峰」一名19歲青年墮樓身亡。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260818/1166364152604659712703846.jpeg/AfHbz4wgO0EKqzQJBw3-89_hSVXIIn9wVzodLHI6HSw\"/><figcaption>「銀湖‧天峰」一名19歲青年墮樓身亡。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-18T05:19:03.509378+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":158,"images":3,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}